# Stone Hill edit home (critical)

www.shmspto.org deploys from **`auraflux-dev/shmspto`** only (git push → treasurer auto-deploy).

## Agent home is pavilion

Cursor agents for this product work in the **`pavilion`** workspace. Do not require a second agent rooted on `shmspto` or a treasurer Vercel login to keep trees in sync.

| Surface | Source of product work | How it reaches www |
|---------|------------------------|--------------------|
| Shared Staff / portal / checkout / Cove | **`pavilion/frontend`** | `node scripts/sync-product-between-repos.mjs --to-shms --apply` then commit/push **`~/shmspto`** |
| Pavilion demo / trial | **`pavilion/frontend`** | robert-4220 deploy (`commons-pto-demo` / `commons-pto`) |
| School-only content / ops | **`~/shmspto`** | commit/push `shmspto` only |

## Sync commands

```bash
# School → Pavilion (demo/trial catch-up)
node scripts/sync-product-between-repos.mjs --from-shms --dry-run
node scripts/sync-product-between-repos.mjs --from-shms --apply

# Pavilion → School (prep www ship)
node scripts/sync-product-between-repos.mjs --to-shms --dry-run
node scripts/sync-product-between-repos.mjs --to-shms --apply

node scripts/shms-frontend-parity.mjs
```

Pushing `pavilion` `main` does **not** update www.

## After a school application ship

1. Commit/push **`~/shmspto`**
2. `node scripts/check-prod-deploy.mjs` (from shmspto)
3. Keep Pavilion current with `--from-shms` when the change is shared product (vanilla)

## Anti-patterns (forbidden)

- `vercel link` / `vercel deploy` Stone Hill from this monorepo (treasurer or robert-4220)
- Editing shared product only under `~/shmspto` while Pavilion stays stale
- Marking www live after a pavilion-only commit
- Hopping Vercel accounts just to copy files (use the sync script + git)
